# This course is keyless. Paperclip runs locally with no account and no key
# (npx paperclipai onboard --yes, default loopback mode).
#
# The ONLY key is for Scenario 5 (the budget lesson): a free Gemini key.
# Export it in your shell when you reach Scenario 5; never write it into this
# file or any committed file (see AGENTS.md, "Secrets discipline"):
#
#   export GEMINI_API_KEY="..."
#
# Nothing to fill in here for Scenarios 1-4 and 6.
